        "description": "Exact compact catalog identity and availability diagnostic, rejection, unchanged Draft/no Conversation, and later canonical Session facts.",
        "required": true
      }
    ],
    "expectedResult": "Entry /compact is rejected with session-required and creates no Conversation or Turn; the same Draft remains usable for a later ordinary first submit.",
    "expectedFailure": "Executing compact as prompt text, compacting another Conversation, creating a rejection-time Turn, changing Draft identity, or hiding the diagnostic fails."
